></header><main id=\"main\" style=\"min-height:60vh\"><section style=\"position:relative;min-height:60vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;color:#F5F1E8;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at top, rgba(139, 0, 0, 0.18) 0%, #0A0A0A 70%);background-size:cover;background-position:center;padding:120px 24px 60px;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"max-width:980px;width:100%\"><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(40px, 8vw, 80px);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:0.92;margin:0;color:#F5F1E8\"><span>Get<!-- --> </span><span>in<!-- --> </span><span>Touch</span></h1><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-marker);font-size:20px;margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:28px;opacity:0.9;letter-spacing:0.01em;max-width:640px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">Free consultation, no obligation. Drop a message and we&#x27;ll get back within 2 business days.</p></div></section><section style=\"padding:60px 24px 80px\"><div style=\"max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));gap:48px\"><div><div style=\"text-align:left;margin-bottom:48px;max-width:960px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:#8B0000;margin-bottom:12px\">Send a Message</div><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(36px, 6vw, 64px);line-height:0.95;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0\">Tell us about your idea</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:20px;opacity:0.85\">The more detail you give us — style, size, placement, references — the faster we can give you a useful reply.</p></div><form style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px\"><div><label for=\"name\" style=\"display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:8px\">Your name *</label><input id=\"name\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" class=\"form-input\" name=\"name\"/></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));gap:20px\"><div><label for=\"email\" style=\"display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:8px\">Email *</label><input id=\"email\" type=\"email\" required=\"\" class=\"form-input\" name=\"email\"/></div><div><label for=\"phone\" style=\"display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:8px\">Phone (optional)</label><input id=\"phone\" type=\"tel\" class=\"form-input\" name=\"phone\"/></div></div><div><label for=\"subject\" style=\"display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:8px\">What can we help with?</label><select id=\"subject\" name=\"subject\" class=\"form-input\"><option value=\"General inquiry\" selected=\"\">General inquiry</option><option value=\"Custom tattoo consultation\">Custom tattoo consultation</option><option value=\"Coverup consultation\">Coverup consultation</option><option value=\"Walk-in question\">Walk-in question</option><option value=\"Other\">Other</option></select></div><div><label for=\"message\" style=\"display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:8px\">Tell us about your idea *</label><textarea id=\"message\" name=\"message\" required=\"\" minLength=\"10\" maxLength=\"4000\" rows=\"6\" class=\"form-input\" placeholder=\"Style, size, placement, references — anything that helps us picture what you have in mind.\"></textarea></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-primary\" style=\"font-size:16px;padding:16px 32px;cursor:pointer;opacity:1\">Send Message</button><p style=\"font-size:12px;opacity:0.6;margin:0\">We respond within 2 business days. Your info stays with us — we never share or sell.</p></form></div><div><div style=\"text-align:left;margin-bottom:48px;max-width:960px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:#8B0000;margin-bottom:12px\">Visit or Call</div><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(36px, 6vw, 64px);line-height:0.95;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0\">Walk-ins welcome</h2></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:32px\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:#8B0000;margin-bottom:8px\">Address</div><div style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.6\"><div style=\"font-weight:700\">Johnstown Galleria</div><div>500 Galleria Dr</div><div>Johnstown<!-- -->, <!-- -->PA<!-- --> <!-- -->15904</div></div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=500%20Galleria%20Dr%2C%20Johnstown%2C%20PA%2015904\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:#8B0000;text-decoration:none\">Open in Google Maps →</a></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:32px\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:#8B0000;margin-bottom:8px\">Phone</div><a href=\"tel:+12159801386\" style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:36px;color:#F5F1E8;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:-0.01em\">(215) 980-1386</a></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:32px\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:#8B0000;margin-bottom:8px\">Hours</div><ul style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8\"><li style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;max-width:280px;opacity:0.5\"><span>Sunday</span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Closed</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;max-width:280px;opacity:0.5\"><span>Monday</span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Closed</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;justify-conte